# Specify files that shouldn't be modified by Fern

# src/main/java/com/whop/api/helpers/oidc is the hand-written OIDC helper. OidcToken and
# IdentityTokens trade a cloud provider's identity token for a short-lived Whop access token and
# renew it using only OkHttp and Jackson, which the SDK already depends on. WhopOidc is the one
# part that touches generated code: the sync builder overrides the setAuthentication hook, and
# the async builder overrides buildClientOptions to add an OkHttp interceptor, rebuilding the
# options with ClientOptions.Builder.from and dropping the generated LoggingInterceptor that the
# rebuild appends again. A regeneration that renames any of these fails the helper's compile.
# Its tests live beside it so a regeneration cannot prune them.
src/main/java/com/whop/api/helpers/
src/test/java/com/whop/api/helpers/
